{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a free demo version of SHINOBI: Art of Vengeance, an all-new 2D action platformer with a unique hand-drawn look created by the team behind the hit brawler Streets of Rage 4. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the demo version, you can explore the first stage of the game, Oboro Village, enhanced with exclusive features not available in the corresponding stage of the full version. These additions are designed to offer a more immersive preview of the full game experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master the way of the shinobi, execute the ninja arts with precision, and journey through a stylized world.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbPlay as the legendary Shinobi Joe Musashi, master of the ninja arts. After finding your village burned to the ground and your clan turned into stone, you must set off on a quest for vengeance, ready to face an unparalleled evil and avenge your clan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489510/extras/9eb0964dfd82a1cf5552422221b07caf.poster.avif?t=1754383849\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489510/extras/9eb0964dfd82a1cf5552422221b07caf.webm?t=1754383849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489510/extras/9eb0964dfd82a1cf5552422221b07caf.mp4?t=1754383849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbEnjoy a thrilling challenge battling enemies and platforming obstacles through the hand-drawn environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489510/extras/0f448cff2b3c778960517e44ce3e943e.poster.avif?t=1754383849\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489510/extras/0f448cff2b3c778960517e44ce3e943e.webm?t=1754383849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489510/extras/0f448cff2b3c778960517e44ce3e943e.mp4?t=1754383849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbDemo enhancements include enhanced ninja abilities, greater enemy variety and a modified shop system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489510/extras/08893986a91e4a45bf620f0ca4bce420.poster.avif?t=1754383849\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489510/extras/08893986a91e4a45bf620f0ca4bce420.webm?t=1754383849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489510/extras/08893986a91e4a45bf620f0ca4bce420.mp4?t=1754383849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbOnce you've conquered the stage, push your skills further by replaying it in Arcade Mode to aim for the highest score and uncover the hidden path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489510/extras/dff395b16dfbcc043d193981ab30eb1f.poster.avif?t=1754383849\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489510/extras/dff395b16dfbcc043d193981ab30eb1f.webm?t=1754383849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489510/extras/dff395b16dfbcc043d193981ab30eb1f.mp4?t=1754383849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">SHINOBI: Art of Vengeance releases August 29, 2025.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*The demo version is not representative of the final game. Progress will not carry over to the full version, but the demo can be played multiple times.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3489510?t=1754383849","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489510/82a2023a597e2ccb0cb87d0daabf28f3764e1460/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754383849","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489510/bcdd28bb943dd7eec0de05e20f385bd9ec79d89e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754383849","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489510/bcdd28bb943dd7eec0de05e20f385bd9ec79d89e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754383849","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a free demo version of SHINOBI: Art of Vengeance, an all-new 2D action platformer with a unique hand-drawn look created by the team behind the hit brawler Streets of Rage 4. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the demo version, you can explore the first stage of the game, Oboro Village, enhanced with exclusive features not available in the corresponding stage of the full version. These additions are designed to offer a more immersive preview of the full game experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master the way of the shinobi, execute the ninja arts with precision, and journey through a stylized world.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbPlay as the legendary Shinobi Joe Musashi, master of the ninja arts. After finding your village burned to the ground and your clan turned into stone, you must set off on a quest for vengeance, ready to face an unparalleled evil and avenge your clan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489510/extras/9eb0964dfd82a1cf5552422221b07caf.poster.avif?t=1754383849\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489510/extras/9eb0964dfd82a1cf5552422221b07caf.webm?t=1754383849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489510/extras/9eb0964dfd82a1cf5552422221b07caf.mp4?t=1754383849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbEnjoy a thrilling challenge battling enemies and platforming obstacles through the hand-drawn environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489510/extras/0f448cff2b3c778960517e44ce3e943e.poster.avif?t=1754383849\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489510/extras/0f448cff2b3c778960517e44ce3e943e.webm?t=1754383849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489510/extras/0f448cff2b3c778960517e44ce3e943e.mp4?t=1754383849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbDemo enhancements include enhanced ninja abilities, greater enemy variety and a modified shop system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragra